# GharOS frontend environment variables.
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development (that file is gitignored).
#
# In deployed builds (Cloud Run `gharos-web`), these must be supplied as
# build/deploy-time env vars — Next.js inlines NEXT_PUBLIC_* values into
# the client bundle at `next build` time, so they cannot be changed at
# container runtime. See frontend/lib/api-base-url.ts.

# Base URL of the deployed gharos-api backend. Read client-side by the
# /status page (PHASES.md Phase 2, E4) to prove the deployed frontend can
# reach the deployed backend. Defaults to http://localhost:8000 when unset,
# so local dev works against a locally-running gharos-api with no setup.
#
# Example deployed value (set by whoever runs the gharos-web deploy):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://gharos-api-971309809251.asia-south1.run.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
